  { title: 'Free walking tours', text: 'Free walking tours depart from Ala-Too Square daily in summer (tip-based). They cover Soviet architecture, Kyrgyz history, and insider food recommendations — a perfect first-morning activity.' },
  { title: 'Local SIM cards', text: 'Beeline and MegaCom SIMs cost 200–300 KGS for 10GB at Osh Bazaar phone stalls — far cheaper than buying at the airport. Bring your passport for registration.' },
];

